[{:db/id 17592186129212 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4a81a076-5ba8-577a-890b-aa9e7b3575b8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129533 :question/problem "A rectangular plate occupies the region\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 3\\}$\nwith mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)=(6-xy)\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},$ where $x$ and $y$ area measured in meters. Find the moment of inertia of this lamina about the origin." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186281611 :question/problem "A rectangular plate occupies the region\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 3\\}$\nwith mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)=(x+y)\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},$ where $x$ and $y$ area measured in meters. Find the moment of inertia of this lamina about the $y$-axis." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186281621 :question/problem "A rectangular plate occupies the region\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 3,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 1\\}$\nwith mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)=(4y+1)\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},$ where $x$ and $y$ area measured in meters. Find the moment of inertia of this lamina about the origin." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-4a81a076-5ba8-577a-890b-aa9e7b3575b8" :question/id #uuid "4a81a076-5ba8-577a-890b-aa9e7b3575b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-163194" :question/problem "![](images/21/2197dd68c567a5232ddf850b7ff8972033eb8cd0d11980baf6dc8e0a198b00a9.png)\n\nA plate occupies the region $D$ enclosed by the $x$-axis and the curves $y=x$ and $y=\\sqrt{2-x}$ in the first quadrant, as shown above. If the mass density function of $D$ is given by $\\lambda (x,y)=12y,$ find the moment of inertia of the lamina about the $x$-axis." :question/worked-solution "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that $D$ is a type II region with representation\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\le x\\le 2-{y}^{2},\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/7a/7a4216a2b1dc3859776c6589459d687981b79b123fa3a5eea638d31529e5cd3a.png)\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{x},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{x} & ={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y}^{2-{y}^{2}}{y}^{2}\\cdot 12y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{y}^{2-{y}^{2}}12{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[12x{y}^{3}]_{x=y}^{x=2-{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}12(2-{y}^{2}){y}^{3}-12{y}^{4}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}24{y}^{3}-12{y}^{5}-12{y}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[6{y}^{4}-2{y}^{6}-\\frac{12}{5}{y}^{5}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =6-2-\\frac{12}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ee942af6-92c3-5281-bece-9270696e9097"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ee942af6-92c3-5281-bece-9270696e9097" :answer-field/id #uuid "ee942af6-92c3-5281-bece-9270696e9097" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f38b0ca8-66e3-5719-b995-f9f532762fcf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c8c52cab-920e-53d2-be8c-5950cc58adf3" "answer-ffe5ef50-f65d-5012-883e-818cd9e57380" "answer-f58fa0c7-d51e-53dc-bd46-b078b8b7cb24" "answer-f38b0ca8-66e3-5719-b995-f9f532762fcf" "answer-1c2da228-1324-5e3d-bd63-eec1ed8297e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c8c52cab-920e-53d2-be8c-5950cc58adf3" :answer/id #uuid "c8c52cab-920e-53d2-be8c-5950cc58adf3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{11}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffe5ef50-f65d-5012-883e-818cd9e57380" :answer/id #uuid "ffe5ef50-f65d-5012-883e-818cd9e57380" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{12}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f58fa0c7-d51e-53dc-bd46-b078b8b7cb24" :answer/id #uuid "f58fa0c7-d51e-53dc-bd46-b078b8b7cb24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{16}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f38b0ca8-66e3-5719-b995-f9f532762fcf" :answer/id #uuid "f38b0ca8-66e3-5719-b995-f9f532762fcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1c2da228-1324-5e3d-bd63-eec1ed8297e7" :answer/id #uuid "1c2da228-1324-5e3d-bd63-eec1ed8297e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186281640 :question/worked-solution "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (r,\\theta ),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, note that the region $D$ in polar coordinates can be expressed as\n\n$$\nD=\\{(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,1\\le r\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\frac{\\pi }{4}\\}.\n$$\n\nAlso, the mass density function in polar coordinates is \n\n$$\n\\lambda (r,\\theta )=10r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the origin is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{\\int }_{1}^{2}10r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{\\int }_{1}^{2}10{r}^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =({\\int }_{1}^{2}10{r}^{4}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =2{r}^{5}\\,{|}_{1}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =2(32-1)(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-0) \\\\  & =31\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-a8a272ef-3322-59e4-8457-62cd9dcd43be" :activity/id #uuid "a8a272ef-3322-59e4-8457-62cd9dcd43be" :activity/title "Moments of Inertia of Laminas About the Coordinate Axes" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049331 :activity/course 17592186046660 :activity/steps ["step-35252b30-f8bd-5e44-b4f4-45a096286b2f" "step-0229ed29-c869-5fed-95fb-449852ec32bb" "step-2ca8bb5b-ad24-5ce9-83fe-edd2440737db" "step-8a57e415-a361-50e5-b0be-77df757bc76e" "step-f7470119-a3e9-55dd-893e-db8aec843ddb"] :activity/first-step "step-35252b30-f8bd-5e44-b4f4-45a096286b2f" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-35252b30-f8bd-5e44-b4f4-45a096286b2f" :step/id #uuid "35252b30-f8bd-5e44-b4f4-45a096286b2f" :step/content 17592186129533 :step/next "step-0229ed29-c869-5fed-95fb-449852ec32bb" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-0229ed29-c869-5fed-95fb-449852ec32bb" :step/id #uuid "0229ed29-c869-5fed-95fb-449852ec32bb" :step/content 17592186281611 :step/next "step-2ca8bb5b-ad24-5ce9-83fe-edd2440737db" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-2ca8bb5b-ad24-5ce9-83fe-edd2440737db" :step/id #uuid "2ca8bb5b-ad24-5ce9-83fe-edd2440737db" :step/content 17592186281621 :step/next "step-8a57e415-a361-50e5-b0be-77df757bc76e" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-8a57e415-a361-50e5-b0be-77df757bc76e" :step/id #uuid "8a57e415-a361-50e5-b0be-77df757bc76e" :step/content "question-4a81a076-5ba8-577a-890b-aa9e7b3575b8" :step/next "step-f7470119-a3e9-55dd-893e-db8aec843ddb" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-f7470119-a3e9-55dd-893e-db8aec843ddb" :step/id #uuid "f7470119-a3e9-55dd-893e-db8aec843ddb" :step/content 17592186281640 :db/ensure [:step/validate]}]
